<title>CHINA: China 1996 oil imports up 32 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China 1996 oil imports up 32 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of crude oil rose 32 percent in 1996 to 22.62 million tonnes from 17.09 million tonnes in the previous year, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Crude oil imports in December alone were 2.09 million tonnes.</p>
<p>China's crude oil exports in 1996 reached 20.33 million tonnes, up 7.9 percent from 18.83 million tonnes in the previous year, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in December alone were 2.37 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
